    "intro_narrative": "Welcome to the Lost Sanctum of Aethelgard, a forgotten magical observatory suspended between the realms of time and space. Centuries ago, the Archmage Kaelen sealed away his greatest creation, the Philosopher's Core, to protect it from creeping shadows. You find yourself trapped within the glowing halls of this ancient sanctuary, surrounded by floating runeboxes, scrying pools, and arcane machinery. The doors have vanished, and the only way to escape is to reawaken the Sanctum's dormant magical network. You must decipher the enchanted artifacts, unravel the spells woven into the observatory, and channel cosmic energies through various magical tools. Piece together the scattered wisdom of the Archmage to restore the grand enchantments. Only by mastering the flow of magic between these mystical relics can you unveil the hidden core and secure your passage back to the mortal world. Beware, for the magic here relies on an unbroken chain of resonance. Follow the flow of energy, and let the stars guide your path.",
    "narrative_style": "fantasy"
